Your skin grows small spikes coated in dark blight.

When you are hit in melee the attacker starts bleeding black blood for 5 turns that deals [8.00, 14, 21, 26, 30 (MAG 10-100)] darkness damage each turn. This effect may only happen once per turn.

You are empowered by the sight of the black blood, for each bleeding creature in radius 2 you gain 5% all resistances, limited to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] creatures.

The damage will scale with your Magic stat.
